local r=fu:GetResolve();local p=r:GetProjectManager():GetCurrentProject();print('PROJECT',p:GetName());print('RENDERING',p:IsRenderingInProgress());for i=1,p:GetTimelineCount() do local t=p:GetTimelineByIndex(i);if string.find(t:GetName(),'v21 FINAL') or string.find(t:GetName(),'v18 FINAL') or string.find(t:GetName(),'v22') then print('TIMELINE',t:GetName(),t:GetEndFrame()) end end